ent/compose?text=https%3A%2F%2Fapnews.com%2Farticle%2Fmet-gala-exhibit-john-galliano-c7677f318cdd038b45804a8810ff94ef%3Futm_source%3Dbluesky%26utm_medium%3Dshare%26nbsp%3B%3Cbr%3EMetropolitan%20Museum%20of%20Art%20cancels%20planned%20Met%20Gala%20exhibit%20on%20fashion%20designer%20John%20Galliano\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n\n<div>\n    <svg>\n        <use></use>\n    </svg>\n</div>\n<span>Bluesky</span>\n</a>\n                \n            </li>\n        \n            <li>\n                \n                    <a href=\"https://share.flipboard.com/bookmarklet/popout?v=2&amp;title=Metropolitan%20Museum%20of%20Art%20cancels%20planned%20Met%20Gala%20exhibit%20on%20fashion%20designer%20John%20Galliano&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fapnews.com%2Farticle%2Fmet-gala-exhibit-john-galliano-c7677f318cdd038b45804a8810ff94ef%3Futm_source%3DFlipboard%20Share%26utm_medium%3Dshare\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <div>\n        <svg><use></use></svg>\n    </div>\n    <span>Flipboard</span>\n</a>\n                \n            </li>\n        \n            <li>\n                \n                    <a href=\"https://pinterest.com/pin/create/bookmarklet/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fapnews.com%2Farticle%2Fmet-gala-exhibit-john-galliano-c7677f318cdd038b45804a8810ff94ef%3Futm_source%3DPinterest%26utm_medium%3Dshare&amp;description=Metropolitan%20Museum%20of%20Art%20cancels%20planned%20Met%20Gala%20exhibit%20on%20fashion%20designer%20John%20Galliano&amp;media=https://assets.apnews.com/a6/c1/9d857c2d7026c81bf57a012a70d3/48d7ac9c7ef14130ae5acc6f65a87564\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    \n    <div>\n        <svg><use></use></svg>\n    </div><span>Pinterest</span>\n</a>\n\n                \n            </li>\n        \n            <li>\n                \n                    <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/submit?url=https%3A%2F%2Fapnews.com%2Farticle%2Fmet-gala-exhibit-john-galliano-c7677f318cdd038b45804a8810ff94ef%3Futm_source%3Dreddit%26utm_medium%3Dshare&amp;title=Reddit%20Share\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    \n    <div>\n        <svg>\n            <use></use>\n        </svg>\n    </div>\n    <span>Reddit</span>\n</a>\n                \n            </li>\n        \n    </ul><p>NEW YORK (AP) — The Metropolitan Museum of Art is canceling its planned Met Gala exhibit <span><a href=\"https://apnews.com/article/met-gala-exhibit-john-galliano-e1dea7639ea16e580251f19822d10db9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">centered on John Galliano</a></span>, the museum and fashion designer said in a joint statement Monday.</p><p>Galliano was at the pinnacle of the fashion world for years before he made a series of antisemitic and racist comments in 2010 and 2011 that went viral, leading to his conviction in an antisemitism trial in France.</p><p>“After much reflection and discussion with The Met and all those involved, I have decided, with great sadness, that it is best for the exhibition not to take place at this time. I remain fully accountable for the pain caused by my words in the past, particularly the hurt I caused to the Jewish and Asian communities, and I remain deeply sorry for it,” Galliano said in the statement.</p><p>The museum said plans for a new exhibit powering the 2027 edition of the Met Gala would be announced later.</p>",
